  "description": "Wedding Day is a captivating script font that exudes beauty and sentimentality. Gracefully designed, its delicate letterforms are the embodiment of timeless devotion. Perfect for creatives in search of a tender and indulgent touch, Wedding Day speaks directly to the heart—transforming ordinary words into extraordinary emotions.\nThis elegant typeface truly personifies love and devotion in every graceful stroke, making it ideal for weddings, romantic invitations, heartfelt letters, and anything that deserves a touch of sincere elegance.\nThis font is PUA encoded, allowing effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Wedding Day</strong> is a <strong>captivating script font</strong> that exudes <strong>beauty and sentimentality</strong>. Gracefully designed, its <strong>delicate letterforms</strong> are the embodiment of <strong>timeless devotion</strong>. Perfect for creatives in search of a <strong>tender and indulgent touch</strong>, <strong>Wedding Day</strong> speaks directly to the heart—transforming ordinary words into <strong>extraordinary emotions</strong>.</p>\n<p>This elegant typeface truly <strong>personifies love and devotion</strong> in every <strong>graceful stroke</strong>, making it ideal for weddings, romantic invitations, heartfelt letters, and anything that deserves a touch of sincere elegance.</p>\n<p>This font is PUA encoded, allowing effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters.</p>",
